        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Paddington, Paddington Bear, A Bear Called Paddington\n- People: Michael Bond, Peggy Fortnum\n- Topics: Animated television adaptations, Children's books\n\nFacts:\n- Paddington Bear first appeared on 13 October 1958 in the children's book A Bear Called Paddington.\n- Michael Bond wrote A Bear Called Paddington and went on to write more than twenty Paddington Bear books.\n- Peggy Fortnum and other artists illustrated the Paddington Bear books.\n- Paddington is an animated television programme based on the Paddington Bear books by Michael Bond.",
